        {'conflictId':'SC-024','title':'Official partial ARM wording versus TTS and licensed variants','status':'resolved-by-authority','questionId':None,'affectedRuleIds':['SEM-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-BOUNDARIES-001'],'evidenceRefs':['SRC-RULEBOOK','SRC-BGA-SERIOUS-WOUNDS','docs/rules/semantics/serious-wound-source-index.json'],'difference':'The official page-3 exposed fragment uses “immediately” and plural “Items”; TTS uses “instantly” and singular “the Item”; licensed uses “immediately” and lowercase plural “items.” The official face is partly overlapped.','resolution':'The official visible fragment controls only that partial occurrence; no missing text is reconstructed and no TTS physical copy is selected by title.'},
        {'conflictId':'SC-025','title':'Direct LEG/KNEE root selectors versus unselected sheet cells and licensed rows','status':'preserved-boundary','questionId':None,'affectedRuleIds':['SEM-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-BOUNDARIES-001'],'evidenceRefs':['SRC-SERIOUS-WOUND-SHEET','SRC-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-38-CELL-04','SRC-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-38-CELL-06','SRC-BGA-SERIOUS-WOUNDS','docs/rules/semantics/serious-wound-source-index.json'],'difference':'The root deck selects three direct KNEE and three direct LEG faces. Same-title sheet cells 6 and 4 print materially different scope/timing but have no root DeckID/GUID selector; licensed rows differ again.','resolution':'Only full raw CardID/GUID/CustomDeck/URL tuples define the six physical copies. Keep both selector-gap cells and all licensed rows independent; title, body, source cell, and CardID modulo never pair them.'},
        {'conflictId':'SC-026','title':'BODY Hand Size versus licensed Cleanup-only refill wording','status':'resolved-by-authority','questionId':None,'affectedRuleIds':['SEM-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-BOUNDARIES-001',*SERIOUS_WOUND_QUESTION_BLOCKS['SEM-Q-035']],'evidenceRefs':['SRC-BGA-SERIOUS-WOUNDS','docs/rules/semantics/serious-wound-source-index.json','docs/rules/open-questions.md:SEM-Q-035'],'difference':'TTS says “Your Hand Size is 1 lower.” while licensed BODY says to draw to 4 instead of 5 during Drawing Action Cards. The rulebook does not define Hand Size.','resolution':'The exact TTS text remains authoritative for its source-bound physical occurrences and licensed wording remains independent; semantic scope is unresolved under SEM-Q-035.'},
        {'conflictId':'SC-027','title':'Direct KNEE local glyph versus sheet Secure and licensed cautious wording','status':'unresolved','questionId':'SEM-Q-033','affectedRuleIds':['SEM-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-BOUNDARIES-001',*SERIOUS_WOUND_QUESTION_BLOCKS['SEM-Q-033']],'evidenceRefs':['SRC-SERIOUS-WOUND-VARIANT-38-CELL-06','SRC-BGA-SERIOUS-WOUNDS','docs/rules/semantics/serious-wound-source-index.json','docs/rules/open-questions.md:SEM-Q-033'],'difference':'The three direct physical KNEE copies contain an unmatched two-lobe glyph. The unselected sheet cell uses the recognized Secure glyph and first-Action timing; licensed text names a malformed Make a Move Cautiously phrase.','resolution':'No default; retain the direct local glyph, selector-gap sheet face, and licensed row independently.'},
